# A tiny quiz counter

::: var score default=0
::: var bonus default=2

Score: {{score}} | Doubled: {{score * 2}} | Rank: {{ if(score >= 6, "gold", "keep going") }}

::: button "+1"
add score 1
:::

::: button "+bonus"
add score bonus * 2
:::

::: button "Reset"
put score 0
:::

Reach 8 points and the deck moves on by itself.

::: when score >= 8
goto 2
:::

